==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|вы́-|вести́}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|вы́вести}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-вывести.ogg}}
* Homophones: {{l|ru|вы́везти}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|вы́вести|pf|impf=выводи́ть}}

# to [[take out]], to [[lead out]], to [[bring out]], to [[move out]]; to [[help]] [[out]] {{gloss|help someone to get off}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''вы́вести''' [[на]] [[чистый|чи́стую]] [[вода|во́ду]]|t=to bring out into the open, to expose, to unmask, to show up}}
# to [[withdraw]], to [[call off]] (troops)
# to [[derive]], to [[conclude]], to [[infer]], to [[deduce]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''вы́вести''' [[формула|фо́рмулу]]|t=to deduce / derive a formula}}
# to [[remove]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''вы́вести''' [[из]] [[состав|соста́ва]] [[президиум|прези́диума]]|t=to '''remove''' from the presidium}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''вы́вести''' [[из]] [[себя́]]|t=to drive someone out of his wits, to drive someone to distraction; to drive someone crazy|lit=to '''remove''' (someone) from [[himself]]/[[herself]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''вы́вести''' [[из]] [[терпение|терпе́ния]]|t=to make someone lose patience, to exasperate someone|lit=to '''remove''' (someone) from [[patience]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''вы́вести''' [[из]] стро́я|t=to put out of action / operation / commission, to disable, to wreck|lit=to '''remove''' from the [[order]]}}
# to [[extirpate]], to [[destroy]]; to [[exterminate]] (pests); to [[remove]] (stains, pimples)
# {{lb|ru|computing}} to [[display]] the [[results]] of a [[program]] [[operation]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''вы́вести''' [[текст]] [[на]] [[печать|печа́ть]]|t=to '''print''' text}}
# {{lb|ru|computing}} to [[save]] the [[results]] of a [[program]] [[operation]] [[outside]] of its [[RAM]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''вы́вести''' [[да́нные|да́нные]] [[в]] [[файл]]|t=to '''output''' data to a file}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|7a(9)+p|вы́вести|вы́вед}}
